"Project deleted — chat and thread together. The event log kept the record."
msgstr ""
"Projekt gelöscht — Chat und Thread zusammen. Die Chronik hat es festgehalten."

#: includes/platon.php:1181
msgid ""
"Please enter a title — and, for a normal thread or a preamble, the text as "
